{"2427790":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Goldilock One: The Mists of Jakaira","steam_appid":2427790,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4767750],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore and Face the Dangers of Nebegarde<\/strong> <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The inhospitable open-air prison on the icy side of a distant planet, where the worst criminals are sent with their memories erased. Venture forth and immerse yourself in a dense plot filled with dilemmas and choices that will reveal the different faces of a reality previously unknown as you seek to understand the reason for your own exile.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/607b51c96aacaf594fd8cbe7df16458f.poster.avif?t=1793725250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/607b51c96aacaf594fd8cbe7df16458f.webm?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/607b51c96aacaf594fd8cbe7df16458f.mp4?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn new attacks by facing challenging enemies<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a warrior, every battle is also an opportunity to learn. Observe how powerful enemies move, attack, and use their special abilities. By defeating them, you can absorb their techniques and transform them into new special attacks, adapted to your character’s combat style.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/fa87d2f5c85695dee06727491162d0d0.poster.avif?t=1793725250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/fa87d2f5c85695dee06727491162d0d0.webm?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/fa87d2f5c85695dee06727491162d0d0.mp4?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge Alliances<\/strong> <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop relationships with various NPCs; depending on your decisions, some may join your adventure as companions. Switch control between them in real-time, accessing unique challenges and previously inaccessible areas.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/6b0b584422dbe3929cf5bfacb5fb2565.poster.avif?t=1793725250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/6b0b584422dbe3929cf5bfacb5fb2565.webm?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/6b0b584422dbe3929cf5bfacb5fb2565.mp4?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/25003edff717df1b979f46e9bda80330.poster.avif?t=1793725250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/25003edff717df1b979f46e9bda80330.webm?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/25003edff717df1b979f46e9bda80330.mp4?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Gear<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use N'skita Crystals to imbue your equipment with special properties. Insert them into available sockets and witness the results—both in the attributes of your gear (damage type, defense, etc.) and in the visual effects seen in your attacks.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/b8793fd4fab2fb46992e091ad1034a3c.poster.avif?t=1793725250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/b8793fd4fab2fb46992e091ad1034a3c.webm?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/b8793fd4fab2fb46992e091ad1034a3c.mp4?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face Unique Enemies<\/strong> <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge creatures ranging from native beings of a new planet to genetically modified creatures and even futuristic machines. Encounter creations inspired by mythological elements from various cultures and Brazilian folklore.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/3bbd2bb163d115799f5eb0a76c692de1.poster.avif?t=1793725250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/3bbd2bb163d115799f5eb0a76c692de1.webm?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/3bbd2bb163d115799f5eb0a76c692de1.mp4?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and loot resources to be used in crafting recipes that can be completed with NPCs. If managed well, your results can bring advantages to your journey, including potions, food, and even equipment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/16113587d022099413e8eda5ff614fcf.poster.avif?t=1793725250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/16113587d022099413e8eda5ff614fcf.webm?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/16113587d022099413e8eda5ff614fcf.mp4?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master your Skills<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a combat simulator to hone your abilities. A secret training capsule created so that exiles can secretly increase their chances of survival.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/8b204b5644923f0e774a92c307aea964.poster.avif?t=1793725250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/8b204b5644923f0e774a92c307aea964.webm?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/8b204b5644923f0e774a92c307aea964.mp4?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Capsule, we’ll have some extra game modes such as:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave Survival (solo)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave Survival (co-op – split screen)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVP (split screen) <\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore and Face the Dangers of Nebegarde<\/strong> <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The inhospitable open-air prison on the icy side of a distant planet, where the worst criminals are sent with their memories erased. Venture forth and immerse yourself in a dense plot filled with dilemmas and choices that will reveal the different faces of a reality previously unknown as you seek to understand the reason for your own exile.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/607b51c96aacaf594fd8cbe7df16458f.poster.avif?t=1793725250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/607b51c96aacaf594fd8cbe7df16458f.webm?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/607b51c96aacaf594fd8cbe7df16458f.mp4?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Learn new attacks by facing challenging enemies<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a warrior, every battle is also an opportunity to learn. Observe how powerful enemies move, attack, and use their special abilities. By defeating them, you can absorb their techniques and transform them into new special attacks, adapted to your character’s combat style.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragrap