.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/25003edff717df1b979f46e9bda80330.webm?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/25003edff717df1b979f46e9bda80330.mp4?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Upgrade Your Gear<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use N'skita Crystals to imbue your equipment with special properties. Insert them into available sockets and witness the results—both in the attributes of your gear (damage type, defense, etc.) and in the visual effects seen in your attacks.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/b8793fd4fab2fb46992e091ad1034a3c.poster.avif?t=1793725250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/b8793fd4fab2fb46992e091ad1034a3c.webm?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/b8793fd4fab2fb46992e091ad1034a3c.mp4?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face Unique Enemies<\/strong> <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge creatures ranging from native beings of a new planet to genetically modified creatures and even futuristic machines. Encounter creations inspired by mythological elements from various cultures and Brazilian folklore.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/3bbd2bb163d115799f5eb0a76c692de1.poster.avif?t=1793725250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/3bbd2bb163d115799f5eb0a76c692de1.webm?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/3bbd2bb163d115799f5eb0a76c692de1.mp4?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and loot resources to be used in crafting recipes that can be completed with NPCs. If managed well, your results can bring advantages to your journey, including potions, food, and even equipment.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/16113587d022099413e8eda5ff614fcf.poster.avif?t=1793725250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/16113587d022099413e8eda5ff614fcf.webm?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/16113587d022099413e8eda5ff614fcf.mp4?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master your Skills<\/strong><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a combat simulator to hone your abilities. A secret training capsule created so that exiles can secretly increase their chances of survival.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/8b204b5644923f0e774a92c307aea964.poster.avif?t=1793725250\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/8b204b5644923f0e774a92c307aea964.webm?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/extras\/8b204b5644923f0e774a92c307aea964.mp4?t=1793725250\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this Capsule, we’ll have some extra game modes such as:<\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave Survival (solo)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wave Survival (co-op – split screen)<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PVP (split screen) <\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Defeat challenging enemies to unlock special moves inspired by their attacks. Survive exile by forging alliances and rallying companions to your side in this action RPG. Develop social stats with NPCs to upgrade shops, expand crafting options, and even recruit them as playable companions.","supported_languages":"English, Portuguese - Brazil, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Dutch, Indonesian, Japanese, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Thai, Ukrainian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/bb71f1064aa157923db4640836ef164d70393fa2\/header.jpg?t=1793725250","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/a2184d94c49f4ae24f3412359dfeb4be94aa5891\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793725250","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2427790\/a2184d94c49f4ae24f3412359dfeb4be94aa5891\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793725250","website":"https:\/\/www.goldilockone.com","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:<\/strong> Windows 8 or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Core I5 or Superior<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li>